OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits trying to hurt police
OL,4,Aofficer with car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has admitted trying to seriously
OL,7,Finjure a police officer who was hit by
OL,8,Fa car.
OL,10,FJonathon Collingwood was initially
OL,11,Fcharged with the attempted murder of an
OL,12,Fofficer in Horden in August, but on
OL,13,FWednesday prosecutors at Teesside Crown
OL,14,FCourt accepted his guilty plea to
OL,15,Fattempting to intentionally cause
OL,16,Fgrievous bodily harm.
OL,18,FDurham Police previously said a
OL,19,FCleveland Police officer suffered arm
OL,20,Fand leg injuries when he was struck by
OL,21,Fa car on 17 August while carrying out
OL,22,Finquiries in their force area.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
