OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits trying to hurt police
OL,4,Aofficer with car
OL,5,
OL,6,FCollingwood, of St Bees Walk in
OL,7,FHartlepool, was remanded into custody
OL,8,Fwith sentencing set for 7 January. He
OL,9,Fpreviously admitted dangerous driving.
